Debug.Assert(Array.LastIndexOf((Array)_items, value, _size - 1, _size + 1) != -1);
</code>

This code works because `LastIndexOf` is a method of `System.Array` class which searches an array for an element using the default comparer and returns the index of the last occurrence of the element. The elements of the array are compared to the given value using the `Object.Equals` method. If no such element is found, it returns `-1`.

